    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (IED) celebrated the creativity and imagination of young artists from across Pakistan at its A.R Nagori National Art Competition. Launched on World Children's Day 2024, the competition provided a platform for children to express their unique interpretations of happiness through art. The closing ceremony was held on International Day of Happiness, reinforcing the importance of emotional well-being and self-expression.",
